<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22084" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεωργ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>agricultural</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκεύη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					552
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόποι γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>CIG</u>
					4659
				</span></i>
			 (Palestine, <span class="entity">iii A. D.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπηρεσία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					197.17
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιβλίον γ.</span>
			a book <i>on rural economy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
			</span></i><i>Cato Ma.</i><i><span class="en">
				25
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ γ.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>) <i>agriculture, farming</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				889d
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ γ.</span>
			<i>lands</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				3.180
			</span></i>; also, <i>treatise on agriculture</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				26b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.649d
			</span></i>; esp. that of Nicander, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.92c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>occupied</i> or <i>skilled in farming</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1317a25
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῆμος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1318b9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					920
				</span></i>
			:— as Subst., <i>a good farmer</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				20b
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>fond of rural pursuits</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.268c
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					7.141
				</span></i>
			.</div>
